# core.rules

## Project Overview
This LLM system integrates Plex, Overseerr, Sonarr, Radarr, FastAPI, Langchain, SQL, and OpenRouter. It extracts metadata from all Plex libraries, stores it in a SQL database with indexing, and supports LLM-based natural language queries and recommendations through a FastAPI GUI.

## Media Types Supported
- Movies
- TV Shows (Seasons + Episodes)
- Music
